# Build context of the all-in-one image (./Dockerfile). An allowlist: anything new in the
# repository stays out of the context — and out of the image — until it is named here.
# (apps/api/Dockerfile builds from apps/api and uses apps/api/.dockerignore instead.)
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/core/
!apps/web/
!apps/api/pyproject.toml
!apps/api/uv.lock
!apps/api/src/
!config/sources.example.yaml

# Never from the host, even inside an allowed folder: dependencies are installed for the
# image's platform, and build output is produced by the image's own build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
